# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# adapter-static is configured with `fallback: 'index.html'` and nothing is
# prerendered, so `build/` contains exactly one HTML file. Without this rule
# Pages looks for `/friends/index.html`, doesn't find it, and serves its own
# 404 - so every route except `/` breaks on a direct link or a refresh.
#
# Files in static/ are copied verbatim into build/, which is where Pages
# expects _redirects to be.
/*    /index.html   200
